{
  "about": "Every knob string of V5_VOCABULARY.md section 9 (9.2-9.5) and CONTROL_CENTER_V5.md sections 15.2-15.3 (knob.* ids) with the element that draws it (PRESENTATION_V5.md 8.6.11). main.cpp renders each one in its element through the firmware parser and renderer; cc54_report.py `copy` checks the drawn lines against the App C limits. placeholder: the text contains a host-filled value ({App}, {title}, ...) shown here with a typical value; the host ellipsizes placeholders first (K3 section 15), so these are reported, not failed. exception: a PRESENTATION_V5.md 8.6.11 exception (reported with its outcome). lines (an element field): the line count PRESENTATION_V5.md specifies for that element (the firmware-local offline strings of 8.10: title 1 line, `Open Desk Dial on your PC` (a no-break space between Desk and Dial, as the firmware's OFFLINE_SUB) two balanced lines, `Knob controls still work` 1 line); a string drawn on another count fails. The offline elements are drawn by the firmware's own offline layer (layout \"offline\"), so their text is also checked against the firmware strings.",
  "elements": {
    "meta": {"layout": "recent", "field": "meta", "role": "list.meta", "limit": 170},
    "status": {"layout": "nowPlaying", "field": "status", "role": "status", "limit": 160},
    "line_tracks": {"layout": "tracks", "field": "subtitle", "role": "tracks.subtitle", "limit": 170},
    "line_seek": {"layout": "seek", "field": "meta", "role": "seek.line", "limit": 170},
    "heading": {"layout": "recent", "field": "heading", "role": "heading", "limit": 138},
    "title": {"layout": "recent", "field": "title", "role": "list.title", "limit": 170},
    "title_tracks": {"layout": "tracks", "field": "title", "role": "tracks.title", "limit": 170},
    "title_windows": {"layout": "windows", "field": "title", "role": "windows.title", "limit": 170},
    "sub": {"layout": "recent", "field": "subtitle", "role": "list.subtitle", "limit": 170},
    "caption": {"layout": "volume", "field": "volumeCaption", "role": "volume.caption", "limit": 170},
    "idle_word": {"layout": "idle", "field": "label0", "role": "idle.word", "limit": 46},
    "offline_title": {"layout": "offline", "field": "title", "role": "offline.title", "limit": 170, "lines": 1},
    "offline_sub": {"layout": "offline", "field": "sub", "role": "offline.subtitle", "limit": 170, "lines": 2},
    "offline_sub_native": {"layout": "offline", "field": "native", "role": "offline.subtitle", "limit": 170, "lines": 1}
  },
